Third-party components
======================

This repository contains only original code and configuration. It does not vendor
any third-party binaries. The installation guide downloads/builds the following:

- Klipper (https://github.com/Klipper3d/klipper) — GNU GPL v3.
  The file klipper/enable-webhooks-socket.md documents a small patch applied to the
  vendor's Klipper fork at install time. Klipper and any patched derivative remain
  under the GNU GPL v3.

- Moonraker (https://github.com/Arksine/moonraker) — GNU GPL v3.
  Installed from source on the device (not vendored here).

- Fluidd (https://github.com/fluidd-core/fluidd) — GNU GPL v3.
  The static build is downloaded from its GitHub releases at install time.

- CPython standalone builds (https://github.com/astral-sh/python-build-standalone) —
  Python Software Foundation License.

- libsodium (https://github.com/jedisct1/libsodium) — ISC License.

- FreeType (https://freetype.org) — FreeType License / GNU GPL v2.

Original code in this repository (panel/, webui/, init/, config/, scripts/, docs/)
is licensed under the MIT License (see LICENSE).
